
---

## 1.3 `.env.example`
```bash
# Required (set locally). In GitHub Actions use repo secret LLM_API_KEY.
LLM_API_KEY=change_me

# Provider: openai (OpenAI-compatible chat completions) or yandex (stub placeholder)
LLM_PROVIDER=openai
MODEL_NAME=gpt-4o-mini

BASE_BRANCH=main
MAX_ITERS=3

# Optional: reduce risk / cost
LLM_TEMPERATURE=0
LLM_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=60
